Subject: [PATCH 01/11] video: include math.h for sqrt()

GCC 14 and newer treat implicit function declarations as errors, so the
build fails on current distributions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/session/channels/video/ch_data_video.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/session/channels/video/ch_data_video.c b/src/session/channels/video/ch_data_video.c
index f8d3baf..69b1c44 100644
--- a/src/session/channels/video/ch_data_video.c
+++ b/src/session/channels/video/ch_data_video.c
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@
  *
  */
 
+#include <math.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
 
 #include "session/channels/ch_data.h"
